      "writtenOn": "2022-12-26T08:03:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. The new patch set adopts your suggestion with minor change:\n1. add PLATFORM_EC_SHA256_HW_ZEPHYR in `zephyr/Kconfig`\n   * it is enabled and select `CRYPTO` if `$(dt_chosen_enabled,$(DT_CHOSEN_CROS_EC_SHA))` is true.\n   * it also makes the sha256_hw.h/sha256_hw.c included and compiled. \n2. PLATFORM_EC_SHA256_HW_ACCELERATE is also enabled if `$(dt_chosen_enabled,$(DT_CHOSEN_CROS_EC_SHA))` is true.\n    Note: we also need to enable PLATFORM_EC_SHA256_HW_ACCELERATE because [common/vboot_hash.c](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/vboot_hash.c;l\u003d74) refers to it.\n\nWith the change, it can pass `zmake build --all --clobber`",
